      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Compared with the dense alloy, the nanoporous alloy will have improved heat-transfer capability.",
      "field": "predicted_outcome",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Compared with the dense alloy, the nanoporous alloy will maintain comparable mechanical properties.",
      "field": "predicted_outcome",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Dense high-entropy alloys currently serve as intermediate layers in plasma-facing reactor components.",
